{"_id":"68fb4515166b018f83dfbf39","roadmapSlug":"swift-ui","nodeId":"BceTgMv9rsRu4j5M7JQRk","description":"# Button\n\nA Button is a fundamental UI element that triggers an action when tapped or clicked. It's essentially a tappable area on the screen that, when interacted with, executes a predefined piece of code. Buttons are used to initiate actions like submitting forms, navigating to different screens, or performing specific tasks within an application.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Button","url":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/Button","_id":"6a7f4ec1cb44947debd16376"},{"type":"official","title":"Populating SwiftUI menus with adaptive controls","url":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/swiftui/populating-swiftui-menus-with-adaptive-controls","_id":"6a7f4ec1cb44947debd16377"},{"type":"article","title":"SwiftUI Button: A Complete Tutorial","url":"https://www.rootstrap.com/blog/swiftui-button-a-complete-tutorial","_id":"6a7f4ec1cb44947debd16378"},{"type":"article","title":"How to create a tappable button","url":"https://www.hackingwithswift.com/quick-start/swiftui/how-to-create-a-tappable-button","_id":"6a7f4ec1cb44947debd16379"},{"type":"video","title":"SwiftUI Button Basics","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gdu6WgIu37A","_id":"6a7f4ec1cb44947debd1637a"}],"createdAt":"2025-10-24T09:21:25.724Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:22:09.974Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/swift-ui/content/BceTgMv9rsRu4j5M7JQRk.md"}